	)
	(text "Distortion / overdrive pedal, Linework series. Audio path, controller and controls, version 0.1.\nBased on GS1 (MXR Distortion+) with Soft/Hard clipping, a DS-1 style Tone control,\na x4 output amplifier and digital pots for Gain, Tone and Level.\nValues match the LTspice model in pedals/distortion/sim/Flashover_circuit.inc."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 45.72 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "b1b0b5fa-b3dc-4e61-990a-7bc67fd386df")
	)
	(text "Signal flow:  Input and Gain  ->  Clipping  ->  Tone and Output"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 99.06 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "54abc759-48a1-44d9-af8d-8bd6b3ff9b40")
	)
	(text "The controller sheets connect to the audio sheets and the controls through global labels\n(HARD_SEL, SDA/SCL, encoder and LED signals) and the +3V3 / +5V power symbols."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 143.51 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "ea37de3c-7b54-45b4-91f0-0953410de8b6")
	)
	(text "Still to be drawn (later sheets):\n- MIDI in / MIDI out (Linework loop)\n- Bypass relay, footswitch and Link LED"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 193.04 154.94 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "04697936-6061-4f6b-ba59-0348dd1725d1")
	)
